    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> be defined as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>odd</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>even</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Then the number of possible functions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi></math> is:</p>",
